WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.350
17 of the top 50 agents in the Snake River MLS work at one brokerage.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:13.050
That’s profound when you look and see that there are more than 200 brokerages registered in this MLS.

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:21.450
One of them is home to more than one in three of the market’s top producers. It’s Keller Williams Realty East Idaho.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:24.950
And that isn’t luck. It’s by design.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.550
See, most brokerages give you a desk, a logo and a good broker,

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:32.650
but for the most part, you’re on your own.

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:35.750
Plenty of good agents have survived that way for years.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:39.750
But is survival truly what you are aiming for?

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:45.550
At Keller Williams Realty East Idaho, you get five full-time leaders whose job is your growth:

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:56.650
a productivity coach, an agent services team, a team leader, an operating principal and a broker. And they pick up the phone, and they go well beyond what most offices can.

00:00:56.700 --> 00:01:01.550
We don’t just teach you how to get business. We teach you how to build one,

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:05.550
with proven systems, tools and models. And we teach you

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:08.450
how to build a purposeful life around it.

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:13.250
Our priorities are God, family, then business, in that order.

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:17.550
We care about the whole of life, not just the next closing.

00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:19.950
Real estate is the vehicle.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:21.750
A more abundant life

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:23.950
is the destination.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:28.450
Rebecca Running started her career at a small brokerage where her friends were.

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:31.550
And in her first nine months, she closed one deal.

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:36.450
Then she joined Keller Williams Realty East Idaho. In her next nine months,

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:37.850
she closed seven.

00:01:37.900 --> 00:01:41.450
Same agent, same market, same amount of time,

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:43.450
seven times the results.

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:46.650
The difference was what she plugged into.

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:50.350
And Rebecca isn’t an outlier. She’s the pattern.

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:56.950
Keller Williams Realty East Idaho has closed over $1 billion in sales every year since 2019,

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:03.150
including $1,030,882,982

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:06.150
in 2025. Boy, that was a mouthful.

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:11.750
And this year we’ve done more sales volume than the next two brokerages combined.

00:02:11.800 --> 00:02:13.650
But let’s be honest.

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:16.150
We’re not for everyone.

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:28.550
So if you want to do one or two deals a year and coast, there are easier places to park your license. We’re built for agents who are serious about growth in their business and in their life.

00:02:28.600 --> 00:02:33.950
More than 200 brokerages. One of them is home to 17 of the top 50 agents.

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:38.150
If you want to be a top producer, the odds say you should be where the top

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:39.150
producers are.

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:41.050
So here’s the question.

00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:44.350
What would seven times your business do for your family?

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:47.650
What if it was only doubling what you’re doing now?

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:49.750
Would it be worth it?

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:53.750
Let’s have a 20-minute conversation. No pressure, no pitch deck,

00:02:53.800 --> 00:02:57.400
just your goals and whether we’re the place to hit them.
